id: imperceptible-strike
name: Imperceptible Strike
advancement: true
prerequisite: N/A
tpCost: 10
source: Time-Skipper
description: >
  Your Attacking Maneuvers made through the Time-Skip Unique Ability do not suffer from, or count towards, the penalty from Diminishing Offense.
text: >
  Imperceptible Strike: You can attack more swiftly and powerfully while you skip through time.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: Your Attacking Maneuvers made through the Time-Skip Unique Ability do not suffer from, or count towards, the penalty from Diminishing Offense.
